## UI Craft: Inline AI prompt bar

Stack: vanilla (HTML/CSS/JS, no dependencies) · Theme: light + dark · States: complete

No `design/` folder or tokens exist, and this is a single component, so I skipped the cold-start question and used the default token names from `design-system`.

### Tokens & architecture
- **Colour and surface tokens:** `--color-surface-default`, `--color-surface-raised`, `--color-surface-subtle`, `--glass-bg`, `--color-border-default`, `--color-border-strong`, `--color-border-focus`, `--color-text-default`, `--color-text-muted`, `--color-action-primary-bg` and `--color-action-primary-text`. Light and dark are defined under `:root`, `[data-theme="dark"]` and `prefers-color-scheme`.
- **Radius and layering:** `--r-xs` to `--r-xl`, and `--z-sticky`, `--z-dropdown`, `--z-command`, `--z-modal`, `--z-toast`.
- **Bar states:** the bar is one `<form>` with a `data-state` of `idle`, `streaming`, `applied` or `error`. Only one action row shows at a time, so there is always one filled primary button.
- **Fixed-height status row:** the status row has a fixed `min-height`, so the layout doesn't jump between states.
- **AI call is a stub:** `runAI()` is a placeholder that streams demo text. Replace it with your real call.

