* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px 96px;
  background: var(--color-surface-default); color: var(--color-text-default);
  font: 400 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
}
:lang(km) body, body:lang(km), :lang(km) { line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: 0; }
h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 16px; }
:lang(km) h1 { letter-spacing: 0; }
.page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
.doc {
  max-width: 65ch; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 16px;
  background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); border-radius: var(--r-md);
}
.doc[data-changed="true"] { border-color: var(--color-border-focus); }

/* ---------- AI bar ---------- */
.ai-bar {
  position: sticky; bottom: 16px; z-index: var(--z-sticky);
  display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 12px;
  background: var(--color-surface-raised);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); border-radius: var(--r-xl);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12);
}
@supports (backdrop-filter: blur(1px)) {
  .ai-bar { background: var(--glass-bg); backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur); }
}
.ai-bar:focus-within { border-color: var(--color-border-focus); box-shadow: var(--glow); }

.field { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.field svg { flex: none; width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.field input {
  flex: 1; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 4px;
  font: inherit; color: var(--color-text-default);
  background: transparent; border: 0; outline: 0;
}
.field input::placeholder { color: var(--color-text-muted); opacity: 1; }
kbd {
  font: 500 12px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  padding: 4px 6px; color: var(--color-text-muted);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); border-radius: var(--r-xs);
}

.btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
  min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; padding: 0 16px;
  font: 600 14px/1 inherit; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--color-text-default); background: var(--color-surface-raised);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); border-radius: var(--r-md);
  transition: transform 140ms var(--ease), background-color 140ms var(--ease), opacity 140ms var(--ease);
}
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); background: var(--color-surface-subtle); }
.btn:active { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98); }
.btn[disabled] { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
.btn--primary {
  color: var(--color-action-primary-text);
  background: var(--btn-gloss), var(--color-action-primary-bg);
  border-color: var(--color-action-primary-bg);
}
.btn--primary:hover { background: var(--btn-gloss), var(--color-action-primary-bg); filter: brightness(1.08); }
:is(.btn, .chip, .field input):focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-border-focus); outline-offset: 2px;
}
.field input:focus-visible { outline: 0; }   /* ring is drawn by .ai-bar:focus-within */

.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.chip {
  min-height: 44px; padding: 0 12px; font: 500 14px/1 inherit; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--color-text-default); background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  transition: transform 140ms var(--ease), background-color 140ms var(--ease);
}
.chip:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
.chip:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
.chip[disabled] { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

/* live status: fixed height so state changes never shift layout */
.status {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px;
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted);
}
.status output { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.dot { flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-text-muted); }
[data-state="streaming"] .dot { background: var(--color-action-primary-bg); animation: pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
[data-state="applied"] .dot { background: var(--color-text-default); }
[data-state="error"] .dot, [data-state="error"] .status { background: var(--color-danger); color: var(--color-danger); }
[data-state="error"] .dot { background: var(--color-danger); }
.status .count { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
@keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.7); } }

.actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; }
/* show only the action row for the current state */
.actions > [data-for] { display: none; }
[data-state="idle"]      [data-for~="idle"],
[data-state="streaming"] [data-for~="streaming"],
[data-state="applied"]   [data-for~="applied"],
[data-state="error"]     [data-for~="error"] { display: inline-flex; }
[data-state="streaming"] .chips { opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none; }

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .field kbd { display: none; }
  .actions .btn { flex: 1; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-property: opacity, background-color, border-color, color !important;
    transition-duration: 120ms !important;
  }
  .btn:hover, .btn:active, .chip:hover, .chip:active { transform: none !important; }
  .dot { animation: none !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
  <h1>Release notes draft</h1>
  <p class="doc" id="doc" data-changed="false">Placeholder text: replace this paragraph with the content the AI bar edits.</p>

  <form class="ai-bar" id="bar" data-state="idle" aria-label="AI edit bar" autocomplete="off">
    <div class="field">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 3l1.8 4.7L18.5 9.5l-4.7 1.8L12 16l-1.8-4.7L5.5 9.5l4.7-1.8z"/><path d="M19 15l.8 2.2L22 18l-2.2.8L19 21l-.8-2.2L16 18l2.2-.8z"/>
      </svg>
      <label for="prompt" class="sr" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)">Ask AI to edit this text</label>
      <input id="prompt" name="prompt" type="text" placeholder="Ask AI to edit this text…" enterkeyhint="send">
      <kbd aria-hidden="true">Enter</kbd>
    </div>

    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Quick actions">
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Shorten this text">Shorten</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Fix grammar and spelling">Fix grammar</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Make the tone friendlier">Friendlier</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Summarize in one sentence">Summarize</button>
    </div>

    <div class="status">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <output id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready. Pick a quick action or type a request.</output>
      <span class="count" id="count" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" data-for="idle" id="run" disabled>Run</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-for="streaming" id="stop">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="10" height="10" rx="2"/></svg>
        Stop <kbd aria-hidden="true">Esc</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-for="applied" id="undo">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 14L4 9l5-5"/><path d="M4 9h10a6 6 0 010 12h-3"/></svg>
        Undo <kbd aria-hidden="true">Ctrl+Z</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-for="applied" id="keep">Keep changes</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-for="error" id="dismiss">Dismiss</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-for="error" id="retry">Retry</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</main>

<script>
(() => {
  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const bar = $("bar"), prompt = $("prompt"), doc = $("doc"), statusEl = $("status"), count = $("count");
  const run = $("run"), stop = $("stop"), undo = $("undo"), keep = $("keep"), retry = $("retry"), dismiss = $("dismiss");
  let timer = null, snapshot = null, lastPrompt = "", cancelled = false;

  const setState = (s, msg, tokens) => {
    bar.dataset.state = s;
    statusEl.textContent = msg;
    count.textContent = tokens == null ? "" : tokens + " tokens";
    const busy = s === "streaming";
    prompt.disabled = busy;
    bar.querySelectorAll(".chip").forEach((c) => (c.disabled = busy));
  };
  const sync = () => (run.disabled = !prompt.value.trim());

  /* ---- STUB: replace with your real streaming call ----
     Contract: call onToken(text) per chunk, return a promise; honor signal.cancelled. */
  function runAI(request, signal, onToken) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      const demo = ("Demo output for “" + request + "” (placeholder, not a real model response).").split(" ");
      let i = 0;
      timer = setInterval(() => {
        if (signal.cancelled) { clearInterval(timer); return reject(new Error("cancelled")); }
        onToken(demo[i++] + " ");
        if (i >= demo.length) { clearInterval(timer); resolve(); }
      }, 90);
    });
  }

  async function start(request) {
    request = request.trim();
    if (!request) return;
    lastPrompt = request;
    snapshot = doc.textContent;            // saved so Undo restores it exactly
    cancelled = false;
    const signal = { get cancelled() { return cancelled; } };
    let out = "", n = 0;
    setState("streaming", "Thinking… “" + request + "”", 0);
    try {
      await runAI(request, signal, (t) => { out += t; n++; count.textContent = n + " tokens"; statusEl.textContent = "Writing… " + n + " tokens"; });
      doc.textContent = out.trim();          // apply
      doc.dataset.changed = "true";
      setState("applied", "Applied to the text.", n);
      undo.focus();
    } catch (e) {
      if (cancelled) {                       // user stopped: nothing was applied
        setState("idle", "Stopped. Nothing was changed.");
        prompt.focus();
      } else {
        setState("error", "Something went wrong. Your request is kept.");
        retry.focus();
      }
    }
  }

  function stopRun() { if (bar.dataset.state === "streaming") { cancelled = true; clearInterval(timer); timer = null; setState("idle", "Stopped. Nothing was changed."); prompt.focus(); } }
  function undoRun() {
    if (snapshot == null) return;
    doc.textContent = snapshot; doc.dataset.changed = "false"; snapshot = null;
    setState("idle", "Reverted to your original text.");
    prompt.focus();
  }

  bar.addEventListener("submit", (e) => { e.preventDefault(); if (bar.dataset.state === "idle") start(prompt.value); });
  prompt.addEventListener("input", sync);
  bar.querySelectorAll(".chip").forEach((c) => c.addEventListener("click", () => { prompt.value = c.dataset.prompt; sync(); start(prompt.value); }));
  stop.addEventListener("click", stopRun);
  undo.addEventListener("click", undoRun);
  keep.addEventListener("click", () => { snapshot = null; prompt.value = ""; sync(); setState("idle", "Changes kept."); prompt.focus(); });
  retry.addEventListener("click", () => start(lastPrompt));
  dismiss.addEventListener("click", () => { setState("idle", "Ready. Pick a quick action or type a request."); prompt.focus(); });

  document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
    if (e.key === "Escape" && bar.dataset.state === "streaming") { e.preventDefault(); stopRun(); }
    if ((e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) && e.key.toLowerCase() === "z" && bar.dataset.state === "applied") { e.preventDefault(); undoRun(); }
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

### States & keyboard behavior
- **Idle:** the `Run` button is disabled until the input has text. `Enter` submits. Chips prefill the prompt and run it at once.
- **Streaming:** the chips and input lock. A pulsing dot, the stage text and a live token count sit in `role="status" aria-live="polite"`. `Stop` or `Esc` cancels, applies nothing and returns focus to the input.
- **Applied:** the changes go into the text right away. `Undo` (or `Ctrl/Cmd+Z`) restores the saved original. `Keep changes` is the only filled primary button.
- **Error:** the status row turns red and the typed request is kept. `Retry` re-runs the same request, and `Dismiss` returns to idle.
- **Focus:** every control has a ≥2px `:focus-visible` outline. The input's ring comes from the bar's `:focus-within`. All targets are at least 44×44px.
- **Reduced motion:** the dot pulse and the lift and press transforms are turned off. Colour and opacity changes stay.
- **Mobile (390px):** the `Enter` hint is hidden and the action buttons share the row width.

### Verification and open items
- **Not run:** I did not run a browser, so the 1440px and 390px widths, the zero-overflow check and the console check are untested. The same goes for a contrast tool.
- **Contrast:** I picked the colour pairs to meet 4.5:1 for text and 3:1 for borders and focus rings in both themes. That is by calculation only.
- **Stub, not an AI call:** the streamed text comes from a `runAI()` stub and is labelled as demo output. No real model is wired in, and no figures or quotes are invented.
- **No tokens file:** I added no `design/tokens.css`. If you want these tokens as a shared foundation, that is a job for `design-system`.
- **Not done:** I did not run the skill's live-agent evals or `npm test`, since this was a request for a design, not a change to a skill.
